{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkvUDQK2pWZm67XS7Yq5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Answer:** On the basic track the account costs me up to 10 ₪ a month, and I should only keep in it the money I'll spend soon. The rest is losing value, so it should go to a קרן כספית יומית. I'm fairly sure about that. What decided it was the box on screen 2: 10,000 ₪ left in the עו\"ש for 10 years is worth 8,203 ₪ in today's money, and in the קרן כספית it's 10,779 ₪. The page never gives an exact amount to keep. The only number I found is 15,000 ₪: above that the bank has to send me a notice. So I'll treat that as the most I should keep there and move the rest out of my 30,000.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **Screen 1:** The heading \"חשבון עובר ושב\" is exactly what I came for. The first price I saw was \"המסלול הבסיסי… עד 10.00 ₪ בחודש\", which covers up to 10 transactions a month, and that's the number I'm holding onto. Then there's a block about changes from 01.10.2026 and 01.07.2027 with 7.00 ₪, 5.00 ₪, 10.00 ₪ and 1.00 ₪ in it. I didn't really get it. It looks like it'll be by number of transactions: 5 ₪ for up to two, 10 ₪ for three to a hundred. I'm not sure which applies to me now. I also didn't know which bank the little \"BANK-17\" and \"BANK-35\" tags meant.\n- **Screen 2:** The top of the \"כמה ריבית מקבלים בעו\"ש\" part seems to be cut off between screenshots. I caught \"כסף שעשוי לצאת היום נשאר בעו\"ש\" and the 15,000 ₪ line. Then the box \"כמה עולה להשאיר כסף בעו\"ש?\" with \"1,797 ₪ פחות\" and \"רוב הבנקים משלמים בעו\"ש: 0%\". That clicked for me. There's a field for my balance, but in a screenshot I can't type 30,000, so I left it.\n- **Screen 3:** Below the chart there were three big numbers: 8,203 ₪, 10,779 ₪ and \"המחיר של להשאיר 2,576 ₪\". Then the line about the קרן כספית יומית and a link to its page. I didn't open the two folds, \"חלק מהבנקים כן משלמים ריבית…\" and \"שחקו עם המספרים שלכם\".\n- **Screen 4:** I saw \"4 מתוך 8 הבנקים… עד 10,000 ₪… 3%, אצל דיסקונט\". So some banks do pay a bit, and Discount is a name I know. I glanced at \"סיכונים ומה לא מוגן\", saw \"אין בישראל ביטוח פיקדונות\", and that scared me a little.\n- **Screen 5:** I skipped the glossary table and the footer.\n\n**What I didn't get:** \"מק\"מ\", \"יתרה\", \"הטבה\", the \"BANK-15\" tags, \"חוקים וכללים · 5\", and the dotted underlines under the numbers.\n\n**What bothered me:** The 2026/2027 fee changes, because I can't tell what I'll actually pay. The chart is basically the second screen, and I didn't read the small print about the 2% and 3.25% assumptions. And the deposit insurance part made me a bit nervous about keeping a lot in the bank at all."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3747,"cache_read_input_tokens":9891,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3747},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b6aa1563-e757-4c90-a49d-32ae500268de","uuid":"458d9fba-482a-459e-b46f-b0763ace42ca","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:56:50.797Z","request_id":"req_011CgkvUDBuFMUjAodzfd15Y"}
